00EB                  (            os9.d):01305         E$BNam              RMB       1                   Bad Name
00EC                  (            os9.d):01306         E$BMHP              RMB       1                   (bad module header parity)
00ED                  (            os9.d):01307         E$NoRAM             RMB       1                   No (System) RAM Available
00EE                  (            os9.d):01308         E$DNE               RMB       1                   Directory not empty
00EF                  (            os9.d):01309         E$NoTask            RMB       1                   No available Task number
                      (            os9.d):01310                             RMB       $F0-.               reserved
00F0                  (            os9.d):01311         E$Unit              RMB       1                   Illegal Unit (drive)
00F1                  (            os9.d):01312         E$Sect              RMB       1                   Bad Sector number
00F2                  (            os9.d):01313         E$WP                RMB       1                   Write Protect
00F3                  (            os9.d):01314         E$CRC               RMB       1                   Bad Check Sum
00F4                  (            os9.d):01315         E$Read              RMB       1                   Read Error
